"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 02 Jan 2025 10:28:29 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (nvidia) - AMD Ryzen 9 9900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2adb5b44-29bb-4d81-a7db-859235388156)\nCurrently in the beta build the shadow-masks are rendered incorrectly. Here I have the shadowmask mode set to **Replace** and you can clearly see the distance at which it switches to the shadow mask and there's a shadowed line.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70d4d39c-649c-4e3a-886a-5eda04fdbc10)\nHere it is with the shadowmask mode set to **None**\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a29b26a9-aa65-475e-a960-59fd69fcd868)\nAnd with the shadowmask mode set to **Overlay** (notice how much brighter the people are, as they're lit dynamically and not with the lightmap)\n\nand finally what it *should* look like (and what it looks like in the editor or when exported as an android build):\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a1cbea1-7205-49f0-a6b0-8b7ff4008562)\nshadowmask mode set to **Overlay** in android build\n\n\nHopefully this is possible to fix, shadowmasks are *incredibly* useful for web builds where performance is paramount.\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a scene with lightmap GI and the shadowmask mode set to replace or overlay and notice the broken shadows. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHere's a simple MRP with the same behavior shown (shadowmasks broken only on web builds):\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/829e1d26-d289-4540-b0c8-6edc5502a1fc)\n\n[shadowmask-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18458584/shadowmask-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101711/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/